## 49, both tubes gone after 2 ectopics, looking at donor eggs, unclear at first whether she or a surrogate would carry

Lead: hi sonia. i'm 49. both tubes went after 2 ectopics, so we're looking at donor eggs and probably a surrogate too. would your program help me prepare?

Sonia: I'm so sorry for everything you've been through.

Just so I understand, are you considering carrying the pregnancy yourself with donor eggs, or having a surrogate carry?

Lead: honestly i'd love to carry myself if my clinic says i can. that's why i asked about getting my body ready for the transfer.

Sonia: Thank you for explaining. I'm sorry, but I only take on women up to 48, so the program isn't something I can offer you. I know that isn't what you were hoping to hear.

Lead: ok. what would you do if you were me?

Sonia: Since you'd be the one carrying, I'd ask your clinic what they'd like you to focus on before the transfer. They know your history and can tell you what matters most for you.

Lead: thank you for being straight with me. most people haven't been.

Sonia: Of course. I'm wishing you all the best ❤️
